graph LR
    MobileUI[Mobile Incident Form] --> SQLiteQueue[Local SQLite Queue]
    SQLiteQueue --> NetDetector{Network Available?}
    NetDetector -- No --> Wait[Wait & Retry with Exponential Backoff]
    Wait --> NetDetector
    NetDetector -- Yes --> BatchSync[Batch POST /api/v1/incidents/sync/]
    BatchSync --> ServerDedup[Server-Side Deduplication & Hash Check]
    ServerDedup --> PostGISStorage[PostGIS Commit & Ack]
